# Module descriptor (used in module admin list)
StrongAuthDescription             =Strong authentication — RFC 6238 TOTP (AES-256-GCM at rest), platform-agnostic WebAuthn Passkey (Windows Hello / iCloud Keychain / Google Password Manager) for internal users, and SSO via Entra ID / Google Workspace / OIDC through Dolibarr's native login pipeline. Internal-domain users are IdP-only; global cross-entity lockout; append-only audit log for SIEM.
