StrongAuthIdpEntraGuide            =In Azure Portal → "App registrations" → "New registration": any name; supported account types = "Accounts in this organizational directory only"; platform = Web with the redirect URI below; then copy "Application (client) ID" and "Directory (tenant) ID", and under "Certificates & secrets" create a client secret and copy its VALUE.
StrongAuthIdpEntraS1               =Open the Entra admin center (button below) → Identity → Applications → App registrations → "New registration". Requires Global Administrator or Application Administrator role.
StrongAuthIdpEntraS2               =Name: anything (e.g. "Dolibarr SSO"). Supported account types: "Accounts in this organizational directory only". Register.
StrongAuthIdpEntraS3               =In the app's "Authentication" section → Add platform → Web → paste the Redirect URI shown below.
